    "description": "Get instant access to global financial markets and learn trading from A to Z.\r\nChoose from 100+ financial instruments and professional tools for in-depth chart analysis. Join one of the fastest-growing international traders' communities even if you know nothing about trading or investments. Learn efficiently and practice for free with our app.\r\n\r\nWhy choose Pocket Broker?\r\n\r\n \u2022 User-friendly Interfaces\r\nThe app was designed by traders for traders. We merged all the fintech industry trends and requirements with outstanding UX practices to create a convenient and clear app.\r\n \r\n \u2022 Advanced Learning Features\r\nPocket Broker is the perfect place to take a first step into online investments. Discover our Help Center with extensive educational materials, or take after the best traders to learn how to analyze the market and find chart trends. \r\n\r\n \u2022 Unique Achievements Engine\r\nPractice, complete simple tasks, follow your progress, gain experience, and receive additional benefits. Just like in video games. \r\n\r\n \u2022 Top Financial Instruments\r\nSelect from the top assets to choose your favorite one. Each Instrument has unique volatility and terms, so it would be a hard choice.\r\n\r\n \u2022 24/7 Support\r\nGet answers to your questions and resolve any issue at any time and place. Just connect with the Pocket Option support services. \r\n\r\n \u2022 Rechargeable Demo Account\r\nPractice investing with unlimited virtual money and refill your demo balance at the click. It is the best way to discover all the app features without effort.\r\n\r\n \u2022 50+ Payment Methods\r\nReveal all the Pocket Broker features with real trading mode. Deposit and withdraw quickly and easily with our wage payment services portfolio. Choose reliable global and local providers that perfectly match your needs.\r\n\r\n \u2022 No Platform Fees\r\nPocket Broker provides excellent conditions for users and gets no fees from deposits and withdrawals. \r\n\r\n \u2022 24 Languages Localization\r\nEnjoy online trading globally in your native language thanks to our fully localized platform.\r\n \r\n \u2022 Secureness \r\nPocket Broker cares about users' confidentiality and safety. That is why our platform is certified by international security licensing.\r\n\r\nStart your trading journey with the Pocket Broker app. \r\n\r\nRisk warning: Our services involve significant risk and can result in the loss of your invested capital. Please read and ensure you fully understand our Risk Disclosure.",
